{
  "name": "MaxVideoAI - Brief to approved generation",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "brief-template-guide", "name": "Template guide: brief to approved generation", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-900, -1100], "parameters": { "width": 900, "height": 620, "content": "# Turn a brief into an approved generation\n\n## Intended user and outcome\nFor producers and creative teams using self-hosted n8n, this template turns a structured creative brief into model recommendations, a project budget, an exact MaxVideoAI quote, one human-approved generation, and a recoverable library result.\n\n## How it works\n1. Brief Input receives `recommendationRequest`, `projectBudgetRequest`, and `generationRequest`.\n2. Deterministic MCP Client nodes list and recommend models, calculate the budget, and call `prepare_generation`.\n3. Human Approval pauses on the exact fresh quote. The workflow proceeds only when the POST body contains `approved: true` and the matching `quoteId`; rejection performs no generation.\n4. `confirm_generation` runs once. Bounded status recovery polls with the accepted `jobId`, then presents the completed result or leaves a timed-out job recoverable by that same ID. Recovery never loops back to confirmation.\n\n## Setup\nImport this disabled workflow into a self-hosted n8n instance. After import, create a MaxVideoAI MCP OAuth credential for `https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp`, complete OAuth in the owner-approved account, and attach that credential to every MCP Client node. Supply the three strict-schema request objects at Brief Input and test the read-only path before preparing a quote. Keep secrets and credential references out of exported JSON.\n\n## Approval and supported scope\nShow the exact current quote to a human and obtain explicit approval for that amount before resuming the webhook. A changed or expired quote requires a fresh prepare-and-approve cycle. This candidate covers the validated deterministic MCP Client path on self-hosted n8n only. n8n Cloud and AI Agent use through MCP Client Tool are explicitly unsupported by this template and are outside the public compatibility claim." } },
    { "id": "brief-prepare-note", "name": "Step 1: prepare a fresh quote", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-900, -380], "parameters": { "width": 1100, "height": 230, "content": "## 1. Brief, models, budget and quote\nAfter import, connect each MCP Client node to your own MaxVideoAI MCP OAuth credential. Brief Input must provide strict-schema `recommendationRequest`, `projectBudgetRequest` and `generationRequest` objects; replace the sample input before running. List Models and `recommend_models` help choose a model, `calculate_project_budget` estimates the project, and `prepare_generation` returns an exact fresh quote. Preparing a quote does not spend credits or start a generation. Check its price and expiration before asking a person to approve it." } },
    { "id": "brief-approval-note", "name": "Step 2: require exact human approval", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [200, -380], "parameters": { "width": 660, "height": 230, "content": "## 2. Human approval is the spending gate\nHuman Approval pauses at a webhook. Show the exact fresh quote to the owner before resuming it. Only a POST body with `approved: true` and the matching `quoteId` can pass Require Explicit Approval. A rejection or mismatched quote goes to Approval Rejected and starts no generation. If the quote changes or expires, prepare a new one and obtain fresh approval; never reuse a previous approval." } },
    { "id": "brief-recovery-note", "name": "Step 3: confirm once and recover by job ID", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [860, -380], "parameters": { "width": 1300, "height": 230, "content": "## 3. One confirmation, bounded recovery\nAfter the matching approval, `confirm_generation` runs once and returns an accepted `jobId`. Wait Before Status and Get Generation Status poll that same job; Continue Polling? bounds the retries. Present Result reads the finished job from the library. A timeout keeps the accepted `jobId` for later recovery; it never loops back to confirmation. Check failed or refunded outcomes in MaxVideoAI rather than assuming a timeout means the job failed or trying the spend again." } },
    { "id": "brief-trigger", "name": "Brief Input", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-900, 0], "parameters": {} },
    { "id": "brief-normalize", "name": "Normalize Brief", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set", "typeVersion": 3.4, "position": [-680, 0], "parameters": { "mode": "manual", "assignments": { "assignments": [{ "id": "recommendation-request", "name": "recommendationRequest", "type": "object", "value": "={{ $json.recommendationRequest }}" }, { "id": "budget-request", "name": "projectBudgetRequest", "type": "object", "value": "={{ $json.projectBudgetRequest }}" }, { "id": "generation-request", "name": "generationRequest", "type": "object", "value": "={{ $json.generationRequest }}" }] } } },
    { "id": "brief-models", "name": "List Models", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-460, 0], "parameters": { "serverTransport": "httpStreamable", "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp", "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api", "tool": { "mode": "list", "value": "list_models" }, "inputMode": "json", "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ surface: $('Normalize Brief').item.json.recommendationRequest.surface || 'video' }) }}" } },
    { "id": "brief-recommend", "name": "Recommend Models", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-240, 0], "parameters": { "serverTransport": "httpStreamable", "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp", "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api", "tool": { "mode": "list", "value": "recommend_models" }, "inputMode": "json", "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize Brief').item.json.recommendationRequest) }}" } },
    { "id": "brief-budget", "name": "Calculate Project Budget", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-20, 0], "parameters": { "serverTransport": "httpStreamable", "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp", "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api", "tool": { "mode": "list", "value": "calculate_project_budget" }, "inputMode": "json", "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize Brief').item.json.projectBudgetRequest) }}" } },
    { "id": "brief-prepare", "name": "Prepare Generation", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [200, 0], "parameters": { "serverTransport": "httpStreamable", "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp", "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api", "tool": { "mode": "list", "value": "prepare_generation" }, "inputMode": "json", "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize Brief').item.json.generationRequest) }}" } },
    { "id": "brief-approval", "name": "Human Approval", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait", "typeVersion": 1.1, "position": [420, 0], "parameters": { "resume": "webhook", "httpMethod": "POST", "amount": 1, "unit": "days", "approvalRule": "Approve the exact fresh MaxVideoAI quote only" } },
    { "id": "brief-approval-check", "name": "Require Explicit Approval", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if", "typeVersion": 2.2, "position": [640, 0], "parameters": { "conditions": { "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 }, "conditions": [{ "id": "exact-approval", "leftValue": "={{ $json.body && $json.body.approved === true && $json.body.quoteId === $('Prepare Generation').item.json.structuredContent.quoteId }}", "rightValue": true, "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" } }], "combinator": "and" } } },
    { "id": "brief-rejected", "name": "Approval Rejected", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [860, 160], "parameters": { "outcome": "No generation was confirmed" } },
    { "id": "brief-confirm", "name": "Confirm Generation", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [860, -40], "parameters": { "serverTransport": "httpStreamable", "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp", "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api", "tool": { "mode": "list", "value": "confirm_generation" }, "inputMode": "json", "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ quoteId: $('Prepare Generation').item.json.structuredContent.quoteId, confirmed: true }) }}" } },
    { "id": "brief-poll-wait", "name": "Wait Before Status", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait", "typeVersion": 1.1, "position": [1080, -40], "parameters": { "resume": "timeInterval", "amount": 15, "unit": "seconds" } },
    { "id": "brief-status", "name": "Get Generation Status", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [1300, -40], "parameters": { "serverTransport": "httpStreamable", "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp", "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api", "tool": { "mode": "list", "value": "get_generation_status" }, "inputMode": "json", "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ jobId: $('Confirm Generation').item.json.structuredContent.jobId }) }}" } },
    { "id": "brief-terminal", "name": "Generation Terminal?", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if", "typeVersion": 2.2, "position": [1520, -40], "parameters": { "conditions": { "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 }, "conditions": [{ "id": "completed", "leftValue": "={{ $json.structuredContent.status }}", "rightValue": "completed", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }, { "id": "failed", "leftValue": "={{ $json.structuredContent.status }}", "rightValue": "failed", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }], "combinator": "or" } } },
    { "id": "brief-poll-limit", "name": "Continue Polling?", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if", "typeVersion": 2.2, "position": [1740, 80], "parameters": { "conditions": { "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 }, "conditions": [{ "id": "bounded-poll", "leftValue": "={{ $runIndex < 19 }}", "rightValue": true, "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" } }], "combinator": "and" } } },
    { "id": "brief-poll-timeout", "name": "Polling Timed Out", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [1960, 160], "parameters": { "outcome": "Accepted job remains recoverable by jobId" } },
    { "id": "brief-result", "name": "Present Result", "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [1740, -120], "parameters": { "serverTransport": "httpStreamable", "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp", "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api", "tool": { "mode": "list", "value": "present_generation" }, "inputMode": "json", "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ jobId: $('Confirm Generation').item.json.structuredContent.jobId }) }}" } }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Brief Input": { "main": [[{ "node": "Normalize Brief", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Normalize Brief": { "main": [[{ "node": "List Models", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "List Models": { "main": [[{ "node": "Recommend Models", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Recommend Models": { "main": [[{ "node": "Calculate Project Budget", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Calculate Project Budget": { "main": [[{ "node": "Prepare Generation", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Prepare Generation": { "main": [[{ "node": "Human Approval", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Human Approval": { "main": [[{ "node": "Require Explicit Approval", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Require Explicit Approval": { "main": [[{ "node": "Confirm Generation", "type": "main", "index": 0 }], [{ "node": "Approval Rejected", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Confirm Generation": { "main": [[{ "node": "Wait Before Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Wait Before Status": { "main": [[{ "node": "Get Generation Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Get Generation Status": { "main": [[{ "node": "Generation Terminal?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Generation Terminal?": { "main": [[{ "node": "Present Result", "type": "main", "index": 0 }], [{ "node": "Continue Polling?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Continue Polling?": { "main": [[{ "node": "Wait Before Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }], [{ "node": "Polling Timed Out", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1", "saveDataErrorExecution": "all", "saveDataSuccessExecution": "none" },
  "tags": []
}
